id=hyperos_adb_install_fix
name=HyperOS ADB Install Fix
version=v1.0.1
versionCode=2
author=WorkBuddy
description=Force-enable "Install via USB" on MIUI/HyperOS without Mi account and SIM. Sets persist.security props and rewrites SecurityCenter remote_provider_preferences.xml (security_adb_install_enable=true, permcenter_install_intercept_enabled=false) on every boot.
